          "subject": "Polr Baseline Password Reset",
          "html": "<h3>Hello alice!</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n    You may use the link located in this email to reset your password for your\r\n    account at Polr Baseline.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<a href='http://polr.test/reset_password/alice/<RECOVERY_KEY>'>\r\n    http://polr.test/reset_password/alice/<RECOVERY_KEY>\r\n</a>\r\n\r\n<br />\r\n\r\n<p>Thanks,</p>\r\n<p>The Polr Baseline team.</p>\r\n\r\n--\r\n<br />\r\nYou received this email because someone with the IP 198.51.100.20 requested a password reset\r\nfor an account at http://polr.test. If this was not you,\r\nyou may ignore this email.\r\n\r\n",
          "text": "Hello alice!\n------------\n\nYou may use the link located in this email to reset your password for your account at Polr Baseline.\n\nhttp://polr.test/reset_password/alice/<RECOVERY_KEY> ( http://polr.test/reset_password/alice/<RECOVERY_KEY> )\n\nThanks,\n\nThe Polr Baseline team.\n\n--\nYou received this email because someone with the IP 198.51.100.20 requested a password reset for an account at http://polr.test. If this was not you, you may ignore this email."
